.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123238#pullrequestreview-5123561267 which is a bug in loading textures in WebGL2 under certain conditions are confirmed bugs that my patches solve for my own game _link removed - not intended as self promotion_ which currently builds custom export templates to carry these patches downstream.\r\n\r\nOn the topic of Copilot, sorry didn't realize it would do that. In this case it actually caught that I had mixed both https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123239#pullrequestreview-5123566220 here and let me fix the PR before it reached you, but I'll keep reviews outside this repo if that is the team's preference!\r\n\r\nThank you for your review and for maintaining Godot 3.x branch!\r\n(from a happy used in a real project! _link removed_ )","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5575415421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5575578449","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123239#issuecomment-5575578449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123239","id":5575578449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTFSTUQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptio